                <pb facs="0768" n="739" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v28/pg739"/>

                <head>186. Action Memorandum From the Deputy Under Secretary of State for Management
                        (Moose) to Secretary of State
                        Vance<anchor n="1" xml:id="d186-f1"
                    />
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1977-03-08">March 8, 1977</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Message from the Secretary on Equal Employment
                        Opportunity Program</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I know that you are genuinely interested in the implementation and maintenance of
                    an effective Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO)
                    program. As far as we can tell, no Secretary of State has ever issued a message
                    on this subject to the Department. Since much depends on the perception of your
                    support for this program, I believe such a message is desirable. A draft, which
                    has been worked on by Mike Janeway,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d186-f2"/> is attached.
                    I recommend that you approve it.</p>



                <xi:include href="d186-a1.xml" xpointer="d186-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
